# S23: Supabase Production Setup

## Objective

Full production database setup: all tables for work-control + todo + notes in Supabase
with Row Level Security (RLS). Multi-tenant isolation: each org has its own RLS scope.
Migration path from local SQLite to Supabase. `scripts/db-setup.sql` extended with S12–S22
additions (memory, analytics views, notes, shared tasks).

## Prerequisites

- S22 CLOSED (all apps auth'd; user_id on all tables)
- Supabase project provisioned (not in code — user action)

## Tasks

- [ ] S23-T01-FreezeInvariants.pd
- [ ] S23-T02-RlsPolicies.pd            — RLS for wc_*, notes_*, todo_tasks per user_id
- [ ] S23-T03-MultiTenantOrg.pd         — org_id column on all tables; org-scoped queries
- [ ] S23-T04-MigrationScript.pd        — SQLite → Supabase migration helper
- [ ] S23-T05-AnalyticsViews.pd         — Supabase views for S19 analytics queries
- [ ] S23-T06-BackupStrategy.pd         — pg_dump schedule / Supabase backups
- [ ] S23-T07-DbSetupSqlUpdate.pd       — `scripts/db-setup.sql` comprehensive update
- [ ] S23-T08-TestsSmoke.pd             — test against real Supabase (CI with test DB)

## Definition of Done

- [ ] All tables have RLS; no cross-user data leak
- [ ] `CORE_DATASOURCE_PROVIDER=supabase` works end-to-end for all apps
- [ ] Migration script exports SQLite → imports Supabase without data loss
- [ ] `bun run test:db` uses Supabase test instance
- [ ] `scripts/db-setup.sql` is the single source of truth for prod schema

## App-agent protocol

All tasks follow `APP-AGENT-PROTOCOL.md`.

## Next

**S24:** Deployment + monitoring (Vercel, health checks, error tracking)
